{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3776070/extras/The_Story.png?t=1752387829\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Embark on a quest to free your Village from a the <strong><i>CURSE OF THE FOREST</i></strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">When an\u00a0<strong><i>Evil Shaman</i></strong>\u00a0cursed <strong>Albadusk Village</strong> and its surroundings with <strong>Dark Magic, </strong>the surrounding Forest grew in a disproportional manner trapping everyone inside. <br><br>A Priest, a Soldier and <strong>you</strong>, a young Novice Priestess, are sent to investigate by the Viceroy. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Now your mission is to break the curse in <strong>Albadusk</strong>!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3776070/extras/mole_hands-ezgif.com-cut__1_.gif?t=1752387829\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3776070/extras/The_Gameplay.png?t=1752387829\" /></div><strong>Beware Nahuales!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Nahuales are Human-Animal hybrid creatures, cursed by <strong><i>The Shaman</i></strong>. Being good at combat will be essential for <strong>survival</strong>.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3776070/extras/combat_2-ezgif.com-cut.gif?t=1752387829\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Explore!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Delve into different <strong>Dungeons</strong> and <strong>Landscapes</strong>\u00a0in your search to break the <strong><i>Curse.</i></strong>\u00a0<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3776070/extras/spider_grabbed_and_kill_spider-ezgif.com-crop.gif?t=1752387829\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Puzzle Dungeons!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Items and Special Spells are required to solve puzzles. But are found in different regions of the game, so exploration is key! \u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3776070/extras/crossbow-ezgif.com-crop.gif?t=1752387829\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Albadusk Village</strong>\u00a0is a HUB where you are  able to access different areas dedicated to a different God. The Eternal, The Nocturnal and Alba the Crossbreed. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3776070/extras/Features.png?t=1752387829\" /></div></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Exploration</strong><br>From <i>Albadusk</i> you can access three different regions to explore. Each containing challenges, puzzles, enemies and odd characters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Mixture of Gimmick and Combat Bosses\u00a0</strong><br>Not every boss is the same. On every encounter you need to figure how to approach.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Puzzle Dungeons\u00a0</strong><br>The only way forward in any dungeon is through wit, attention to detail, and reasoning.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Uncover deep lore</strong><br>Learn the <strong><i>legend of Velcira</i></strong> the first <strong>Priestess</strong>, the <strong><i>Eternal gods</i></strong>, and the mystery of <strong><i>the Shaman</i></strong>.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Atmosphere\u00a0</strong><br>Inspired by <strong>the N64 Era</strong>, with the <strong>soul of a survival horror</strong>   <br>Dungeon design, free exploration, and a constant sense of danger and discovery.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>A Dark religious aesthetics</strong><br>Culturally inspired on\u00a0<strong><i>Mexican Culture and Catholicism</i></strong>\u00a0featuring <strong><i>Gothic and Baroque</i></strong> art-style, and a liturgical nightmare ambiance all flavored with inspirations </p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3776070?t=1752387829","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3776070?t=1752387829","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3776070/41961167f8bdc541c257b051ca1cf5c798f4b797/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1752387829","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3776070/41961167f8bdc541c257b051ca1cf5c798f4b797/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1752387829","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Surround Sound","id":70},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3776070/extras/The_Story.png?t=1752387829\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Embark on a quest to free your Village from a the <strong><i>CURSE OF THE FOREST</i></strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">When an\u00a0<strong><i>Evil Shaman</i></strong>\u00a0cursed <strong>Albadusk Village</strong> and its surroundings with <strong>Dark Magic, </strong>the surrounding Forest grew in a disproportional manner trapping everyone inside. <br><br>A Priest, a Soldier and <strong>you</strong>