ifferent areas dedicated to a different God. The Eternal, The Nocturnal and Alba the Crossbreed. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3776070/extras/Features.png?t=1752387829\" /></div></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Exploration</strong><br>From <i>Albadusk</i> you can access three different regions to explore. Each containing challenges, puzzles, enemies and odd characters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Mixture of Gimmick and Combat Bosses\u00a0</strong><br>Not every boss is the same. On every encounter you need to figure how to approach.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Puzzle Dungeons\u00a0</strong><br>The only way forward in any dungeon is through wit, attention to detail, and reasoning.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Uncover deep lore</strong><br>Learn the <strong><i>legend of Velcira</i></strong> the first <strong>Priestess</strong>, the <strong><i>Eternal gods</i></strong>, and the mystery of <strong><i>the Shaman</i></strong>.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Atmosphere\u00a0</strong><br>Inspired by <strong>the N64 Era</strong>, with the <strong>soul of a survival horror</strong>   <br>Dungeon design, free exploration, and a constant sense of danger and discovery.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>A Dark religious aesthetics</strong><br>Culturally inspired on\u00a0<strong><i>Mexican Culture and Catholicism</i></strong>\u00a0featuring <strong><i>Gothic and Baroque</i></strong> art-style, and a liturgical nightmare ambiance all flavored with inspirations </p></li></ul>","developers":["zombiebytegames"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3776070/a316001